DB query timeout
external HTTP timeout
shutdown timeout

Configuration:

REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=10
DATABASE_CONNECT_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=5
SHUTDOWN_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=20
